WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.836
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)
-Very hyped-up crowd tonight.

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.236
-Yes, I know why.
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:06.539
-(LAUGHS)
-(CROWD CHEERING)

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:11.678
-Well... I know it's because...
-(CROWD APPLAUDING)

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:12.778
...we're in Hollywood,

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.947
and the actors' strike
is finally over.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:18.851
-The--
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:18.984 --> 00:00:21.621
For you-- for you
younger people watching,

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.556
the-- the actors
are the people in movies

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:24.891
pointing at the CGI...

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:27.727
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-...basically.

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:29.628
But, no, I worry.

00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:31.130
I mean,
with the actors' strike over,

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:34.767
who's gonna figure out
the Israeli-Palestinian conflict
on Twitter.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:39.105
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-Oh, here's where we are...

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:42.107
-(CHUCKLES)
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:43.543
Here's where we are with that,

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:46.045
the Museum of Tolerance,
here in L.A.

00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:48.180
-(MAN LAUGHING)
-The Museum of Tolerance.

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.449
-(LAUGHS)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:50.582 --> 00:00:52.285
They had a showing-- a movie
about this,

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:53.786
and fist fights broke out.

00:00:53.919 --> 00:00:54.920
-(SMACKS LIPS)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:57.090
Fourteen people
were treated for irony.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.225
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:02.862
At the Museum of Tolerance,
that's where we are.

00:01:02.995 --> 00:01:04.697
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.299
Well, and they--
they were showing,

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:10.203
43 minutes of the Hamas attack
on October 7th in Israel,

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:13.005
and without
any editorialization,

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:14.774
just the footage
that they themselves,

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:17.276
Hamas, took
and wanted the world to see.

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:19.612
But the pro-Palestinian people
did demonstrate

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:20.713
they do not like this.

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:24.517
The college kids
especially think that the--

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:26.486
Well, they prefer to think
of the Hamas people

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:29.855
as just a kind
of a ragtag bunch of underdogs,

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:32.492
kind of the Bad News Bears
of the Middle East.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:36.629
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:41.234
This was a big topic
at the Republican debate
last night.

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.002
I don't know
if you saw that, the--

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:44.303
Oh, I guess not.

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.805
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-I didn't either. I didn't.

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:47.373
I can't lie. I wouldn't.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:49.942
-Please.
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:01:50.075 --> 00:01:51.077
Well...

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:54.647
they're down to five candidates
on the island now,

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:57.216
-and...
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:57.349 --> 00:02:00.119
...all of them,
Trump is beating by 40 points.

00:02:00.252 --> 00:02:03.021
The only reason to be in this
is to be there

00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:05.258
if Trump
for some reason can't run.

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:08.360
That's the one thing Republicans
and Democrats have in common now

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:10.529
they're both waiting
for their nominees to die.

00:02:10.662 --> 00:02:16.469
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(LAUGHS)

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:18.271
But there was a--

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:22.008
It was a good-news-bad-news week
for the Democrats.

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:24.911
Bad news in--
in the six Battleground States.

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:28.447
Trump is beating Biden
in five out of six of them.

00:02:28.714 --> 00:02:32.818
And Biden support
among non-White voters

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:35.087
dropped 33 points, and this--

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:37.956
Democrats cannot win
with just White people.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:42.862
-(SMACKS LIPS)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:02:42.995 --> 00:02:49.769
-Oh, oh, oh! (LAUGHS)
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:02:49.902 --> 00:02:51.638
Although,
it hasn't hurt Taylor Swift.

